---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AppStoreCta from "../../components/AppStoreCta.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Family travel documents — Passport Pack guide"
  description="Keep passports, licenses, and visas for the whole family encrypted on one iPhone — without dumping them into Photos."
>
  <article class="prose-page">
    <div class="container prose-page__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Guide</p>
      <h1 class="display prose-page__title">Family travel documents on one iPhone.</h1>
      <p class="prose-page__lede muted">
        Packing week is when folders of passport photos appear in Recents. Passport Pack is built for
        the family packing list — under one master password, not a shared album.
      </p>

      <section class="prose-block">
        <h2>The packing-week failure mode</h2>
        <p>
          Parents often photograph every passport and license “just in case,” then leave those images
          in Photos for months. Shared devices, babysitter handoffs, and airline form fills all pull
          from the same unencrypted library.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-block">
        <h2>What Passport Pack packages for families</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Profiles</strong> — paid unlocks family profiles so each person’s docs stay
            organized under the same vault password.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Unlimited documents</strong> — free is capped at three docs / Me; paid removes the
            cap when the archive grows.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Expiry reminders</strong> — paid expiry nudges for passports and visas without
            relying on a calendar screenshot in Photos.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Launch paid features intentionally exclude iCloud / CloudKit sync. The vault stays on this
          iPhone until a paid-sync story is ready.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-block">
        <h2>A simple family workflow</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Create the vault with a master password you will not forget (or store offline).</li>
          <li>Scan each passport / license into Passport Pack — confirm OCR fields on device.</li>
          <li>Upgrade when you need a second person or a fourth document.</li>
          <li>Delete leftover Photos copies from Recents and Recently Deleted.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <div class="prose-cta">
        <AppStoreCta label="Get Passport Pack" />
        <a class="prose-link" href={withBase("/guides/passport-in-photos")}>Passport in Photos guide →</a>
        <a class="prose-link" href={withBase("/privacy")}>Privacy &amp; support →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
